<title>USA: Advanced Digital stake held by Vinik group.</title>
<headline>Advanced Digital stake held by Vinik group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by Boston investor and former Fidelity Magellan Fund manager Jeffrey Vinik on Monday said it acquired 479,700 common shares of Advanced Digital Information Corp, or 6.0 percent of the total outstanding.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it acquired the stake for investment purposes.</p>
<p>It said it bought 479,700 of the shares between December 3 and January 6 at prices ranging from $14.1745 to $18.50 each.</p>
</text>
